X:1
T:Erddigan Hun Gwenllian
R:alaw
S:Taught by Stephen Rees; played on Y Glerorfa's CD "Y Glerorfa yn Fyw" (sent by Steve Jeans)
N:The earliest version Steve Jeans has found is in Edward Jones's Bardic Museum (1802). Its footnote says Gwenllian was the daughter of Prince Rhys ab Griffith and the wife of Ednyfed Vychan, and that she died in 1190.
